    "## phon.egg_to_oq()\n",
    "\n",
    "With a stereo audio file having audio in the left (channel 0) and electroglottography in the right (channel 1),\n",
    "this function returns a time axis, f0, and open quotient.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
